}

// DELEGATED, NOT OPERATOR. Authoring the rows was agent work and is spelled as such; only the
// operator input below is operator-exclusive. Spelling this one OperatorActionWork would have
// inflated the operator's queue with work that was never theirs. It is DISCHARGED, and it is what
// makes in_progress_items_carry_receipt_and_residue hold for this item -- an item claiming progress
// with nothing discharged is an item nobody started.
data step_m2_data_map_author: OwnerStep = OwnerStep {
